# 2D thick-walled cylinder (annulus): #@disk with one #@holedisk.
# Coarse version of the mesh in oofem-examples/lattice-coupling-pressure-2d
# (inner radius 0.008, outer radius 0.025).
#@output nodes.dat
#@domain 2
#@diam 0.004
#@maxiter 100000
#@ranint -1
#@perflag 2 0 0
#@ranflag 1
# bounding-box corners widen the localiser
#@vertex 1 coords 2 -0.026 -0.026 refine 1. radius 0.
#@vertex 2 coords 2  0.026  0.026 refine 1. radius 0.
#@disk 1 centre 2 0.0 0.0 radius 0.025
#@holedisk 1 centre 2 0.0 0.0 radius 0.008 refine 0.5
#@controlvertex 1 coords 2  0.025  0.0
#@controlvertex 2 coords 2  0.0    0.025
#@controlvertex 3 coords 2  0.0   -0.025
